  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ba2ac043a0776a4d846aaf6ba38a734, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: 
  description: "This scene demonstrates the different types of rotation.\r\n\nThe
    agent first rotates towards a target object (here the first waypoint), then towards
    a coordinate (the coordinates of the second waypoint), \rand then rotates by
    45\xB0 and then towards 90\xB0.\n\nFinally, it walks up to the ObjectOfInterest
    and then rotates towards it."
  type: 0
  url: https://rwth-acis.github.io/Virtual-Agents-Framework/2.0.0/manual/rotation.html
